<title>CHINA: Peace Mark year net jumps 56 pct.</title>
<headline>Peace Mark year net jumps 56 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.3 vs 1.6 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    0.5 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    21.45 vs 13.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		     469.90 vs 421.15</p>
<p>    Company name		 Peace Mark (Holdings) Limited</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 10-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Oct 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Peace Mark makes quartz analog watches and clocks. Total dividend for year is 0.5 cents vs nil. Earnings per share for the year ended March 31, 1996 has been adjusted for the one for five bonus issue during the year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
